# profile - semantic work measurement

@func counts
@template "counts(function)"
@help "Measures the Aiki-level work performed by one zero-argument function call."

@func measure
@template "measure(function)"
@help "Measures semantic work and returns both totals and source-site attribution."

@func experiment
@template "experiment(size, function)"
@help "Measures function(size), independently for one size or each size in a list."

@func complexity
@template "complexity(results)"
@help "Classifies observed growth of each semantic unit in experiment results."
